          <p>2  Application</p>
          <p>The amendment made by item 1 applies to increases in the rate of duty of an excise item under <ref href="#sec-6A">section 6A</ref> of the <i>Excise Tariff Act 1921</i> that occur on or after 1 August 2001.</p>
          <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
          <p><i>House of Representatives on 24 May 2001</i></p>
          <p>(76/01)</p>
          <p><i>Senate on 19 June 2001</i>]</p>
